{"page":232,"w":7029,"h":11508,"lines":[{"conf":1,"x":0.27078385302265773,"w":0.44893111191786728,"h":0.021860003471374512,"text":"\"Thou it is, who gently breakest","y":0.93895348869587869},{"h":0.020371908233279279,"text":"These fair shelters we invent,","conf":1,"x":0.32066508824947704,"y":0.91567460283910007,"w":0.40142517585258974},{"w":0.44418052574256794,"text":"That eternal light may wake us;","y":0.89384920662473732,"x":0.28978621891315792,"h":0.020394979015229242,"conf":1},{"x":0.32037778911402182,"text":"Therefore do I not lament.\"","conf":1,"y":0.87184127298541303,"w":0.39009228000393159,"h":0.02525207542237784},{"w":0.81472684191418931,"text":"The poems of Eichendorff may seem to us to-day to be an","y":0.82558139578393297,"h":0.02040074742029574,"x":0.11638955398352288,"conf":1},{"text":"echo from a happier, now vanished, world. But this poem","y":0.80232558155258904,"conf":1,"w":0.81710211023107748,"x":0.11401425874036007,"h":0.02183116428435794},{"x":0.11401425785549316,"w":0.81947742808948865,"y":0.7805059526395155,"h":0.02036613982821267,"text":"shows that in the last resort it is not a question of a greater","conf":1},{"w":0.81710211023107748,"conf":1,"text":"or lesser degree of good fortune, and that even in a so-called","h":0.021877306794363283,"x":0.11401425874036007,"y":0.75719246032068332},{"text":"prosperous age a serious-minded man sees how our life is","conf":1,"x":0.11372534062473315,"y":0.73412271289579301,"h":0.025420433945126053,"w":0.81995664324079243},{"x":0.11163895474979257,"w":0.81947742808948865,"h":0.021883075199430002,"conf":1,"text":"shadowed by death, and that the way to God leads through","y":0.71075581392298626},{"x":0.11401424922298561,"conf":1,"y":0.69040697691353858,"text":"the \"dark night of the soul\": \"Thou it is who gently breakest","w":0.81947742808948865,"h":0.021894610117352276},{"text":"the fair shelters we build, that eternal light may break upon","w":0.81710211023107759,"h":0.020348837451329427,"conf":1,"y":0.66715116288837639,"x":0.11401426388683661},{"h":0.021825396825396748,"y":0.64533730150251478,"conf":1,"text":"us\" —this is the very same truth that Luther's words sharply","w":0.81947742808948865,"x":0.11401424824741727},{"h":0.017305482001531702,"y":0.62579493330716862,"x":0.11380254484682022,"w":0.1286894439102767,"conf":1,"text":"enforced."},{"w":0.7838479574624595,"conf":1,"text":"And is all that I have been saying a Christian sermon","h":0.020441121525234585,"y":0.60019841306873933,"x":0.14726842591756567},{"text":"about the grace of God? Most surely; for the message of","y":0.57703488381860901,"h":0.020435354066273503,"w":0.82185269640637681,"conf":1,"x":0.11401427804384233},{"conf":1,"text":"divine grace does not suggest that the cross will be spared us,","y":0.5552325584625043,"w":0.81947742808948865,"h":0.020412282338218124,"x":0.11401426327116997},{"conf":1,"x":0.11638955692295272,"y":0.53197674415554441,"w":0.81472684191418931,"h":0.021842700148385741,"text":"but rather that the cross itself is grace; that God slays in"},{"h":0.020354604910290508,"conf":1,"w":0.81710211023107748,"text":"order to make alive. And real genuine patience of disposition","x":0.11401425874036007,"y":0.51016865047894933},{"y":0.4868551589996335,"w":0.81947742808948865,"h":0.021865770930335593,"text":"consists in this—in our readiness to hear, in the \"no\" by","conf":1,"x":0.11401424824741727},{"h":0.021923449304368736,"w":0.82185269640637681,"y":0.46354166646014505,"text":"which God negates our desires and our will, His secret \"yes\".","x":0.11401427370892557,"conf":1},{"text":"And in this sense let us take to heart the truth of the following","conf":1,"x":0.11378768510094507,"y":0.44173977007652065,"w":0.82003927850103986,"h":0.026178445134844019},{"x":0.11401425357410774,"conf":1,"w":0.24465558436009791,"text":"words in our text:","y":0.4228670632080328,"h":0.017609126984126977},{"x":0.14489311698690732,"y":0.37645348883214325,"conf":1,"w":0.45843228426846594,"text":"\"It is good for a man that he bear","h":0.021860003471374512},{"x":0.16152019813683541,"h":0.020371908233279279,"y":0.35317460304258841,"text":"the yoke in his youth.","conf":1,"w":0.29928739968832441},{"conf":1,"text":"Let him sit alone in silence","x":0.16389549262677833,"y":0.33283730191733829,"h":0.017453395185016429,"w":0.37054631617162131},{"w":0.38562286674202262,"conf":1,"x":0.16119866130451763,"y":0.30800001527020393,"h":0.02346706201159765,"text":"when he has laid it on him;"},{"conf":1,"y":0.28633720980798172,"h":0.018970329610128234,"w":0.48931116872019587,"x":0.16152019250451002,"text":"let him put his mouth in the dust—"},{"text":"there may yet be hope;","x":0.16355306564294575,"y":0.26153639471174228,"w":0.32135869311047838,"h":0.022408447568378786,"conf":1},{"text":"let him give his cheek to the smiter,","w":0.49406175489549509,"y":0.23834325406788415,"conf":1,"h":0.02183116428435794,"x":0.16152019496487535},{"conf":1,"text":"and be filled with insults.","y":0.21937368076569486,"h":0.02230528801206566,"w":0.34981695398107754,"x":0.16131742367534535},{"conf":1,"x":0.16323254039598664,"w":0.52652007263976253,"y":0.19165781008234106,"h":0.029220612276168123,"text":"For the Lord will not cast off for ever,"},{"conf":1,"h":0.024251807303655726,"y":0.16949582001471242,"w":0.70356646451083094,"x":0.16362660103457152,"text":"but, though he cause grief, he will have compassion"},{"w":0.68218374871588372,"conf":1,"x":0.16132423302499443,"y":0.1481934373796443,"h":0.023380137625194752,"text":"according to the abundance of his steadfast love;"},{"text":"for he does not willingly afflict","conf":1,"w":0.41805222746613746,"y":0.12645348868679429,"x":0.16152020687923008,"h":0.021860003471374512},{"text":"or grieve the sons of men.","conf":1,"w":0.35391923978731221,"x":0.16152019303191786,"y":0.10610465161272986,"h":0.018895348859211736},{"y":0.078488372275488771,"conf":1,"text":"236","x":0.49406175965510035,"w":0.052256528433267113,"h":0.0203488365052239}]}